{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Planet Toy, our hero Jack sleeps in and misses Grow up Day. Help Jack find the secret spaceship that is hidden in the core of Planet Toy and help him reach the Planet of Adults. There he'll discover that growing up isn't what he thought it was. Grab your slingshot and fight imaginative creations. Guide your spaceship through the fiery, asteroid zones with the help of your anti-asteroid lasers. Battle memorable bosses that unlock abilities and drop Epic Loot. Make choices that matter in what you grow up to be! This is our attempt to combine the old fashioned platformers, with modern graphics and meaningful storytelling. Coming Soon!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692300?t=1767730759","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692300?t=1767730759","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692300/7809b19746435d53b16fb7d4717eff21ce8471a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767730759","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692300/7809b19746435d53b16fb7d4717eff21ce8471a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767730759","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3716450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Planet Toy, our hero Jack sleeps in and misses Grow up Day. Help Jack find the secret spaceship that is hidden in the core of Planet Toy and help him reach the Planet of Adults. There he'll discover that growing up isn't what he thought it was. Grab your slingshot and fight imaginative creations. Guide your spaceship through the fiery, asteroid zones with the help of your anti-asteroid lasers. Battle memorable bosses that unlock abilities and drop Epic Loot. Make choices that matter in what you grow up to be! This is our attempt to combine the old fashioned platformers, with modern graphics and meaningful storytelling. Coming Soon!</p>","developers":["Georgios Gyftopoulos"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692300/932160d9057519913f6096ba82437831488d005d/header.jpg?t=1767730759","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3692300/877206/437841215846d76e87e6564c71bcc4ce81817f74/1750405196/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747069121","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3692300/877206/437841215846d76e87e6564c71bcc4ce81817f74/1750405196/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747069121","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3692300/877206/437841215846d76e87e6564c71bcc4ce81817f74/1750405196/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747069121","id":257130356,"name":"Chronicles of Childhood Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130356/5dccb9e4e8a893ac5d440755fd35c041747fcf3a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747069121"}],"name":"Chronicles of Childhood","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publi